        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.1</title>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:12:31 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <title>App Detective 1.6.1 — Release notes</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --background: #f7f8fa;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #20242c;
      --muted: #626b78;
      --border: #dfe4ec;
      --accent: #1d4ed8;
      --tint: #eaf1ff;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --background: #181b21;
        --surface: #22262e;
        --text: #edf0f6;
        --muted: #adb6c5;
        --border: #3b424f;
        --accent: #93baff;
        --tint: #283b5d;
      }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font: 13px/1.65 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
    .release { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    header { padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
    .metadata { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 14px; color: var(--muted); }
    .version { padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--tint); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 650; }
    main h2 { margin: 24px 0 10px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.35; }
    main ul, main ol { margin: 0; padding: 16px 18px 16px 34px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--surface); }
    main li + li { margin-top: 10px; }
    main li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
    main li ul, main li ol { margin-top: 10px; padding: 0 0 0 18px; border: 0; }
    code { padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--tint); font: 0.92em ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
    pre { overflow-x: auto; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface); }
    pre code { padding: 0; background: transparent; }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 2px; }
    footer { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 420px) { body { padding: 16px; } h1 { font-size: 24px; } }
    @media (prefers-contrast: more) { :root { --muted: var(--text); --border: var(--text); } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="release">
    <header>
      <h1>What’s new</h1>
      <div class="metadata"><span class="version">v1.6.1</span><time datetime="2026-10-29">October 29, 2026</time></div>
    </header>
    <main>
<ul>
<li>The inspector shows who signed an app, such as <strong>Developer ID Application: Company Name (TEAMID)</strong>, the certificate <code>codesign</code> lists first as its Authority. The command-line tool prints it as <strong>Signed By</strong> (<code>signer</code> in <code>--json</code>), and exported JSON and CSV include it.
</li>
<li>Calmer colors: app tags are neutral capsules with a colored dot, sidebar icons are gray, and only the active filters are highlighted instead of every section's <strong>All</strong> row.
</li>
<li>Evidence lists an item once per trait when several rules match it, such as Rust's two code strings in one binary, with every matched rule in its tooltip.
</li>
<li>The update prompt shows these release notes instead of linking to the GitHub release page.
</li>
<li>Cached results are re-detected on first launch.
</li></ul>
    </main>
    <footer><a href="https://github.com/hewigovens/app-detective/releases">All releases</a></footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

